  "description": "Source generator for TimeWarp.Mediator: builds the message graph at compile time and emits a sealed, reflection-free, AOT-friendly IMediator plus per-scope ISender<TScope>/IPublisher<TScope> named pipelines and AddGeneratedMediator() registration. Reports TWM007, TWM008, TWM010, and TWM011, TWM012 when a GeneratedHandlerAttribute name is not a constant, and TWM013 when a GeneratedRequestPatternAttribute cannot be read or expanded. TWM001–TWM004 and the missing-handler half of TWM012 ship in the TimeWarp.Mediator package.",
